# W on the last Upcoming entry makes it due tomorrow and moves it into the Tomorrow group in document order, keeping the focus on it.
file <<END
- Late @due({today+6})
- Early @due({today+1})
END
keys gU G
see ▌ - Late
keys W j
see ▌ - Early
quit
saved <<END
- Late @due({today+1})
- Early @due({today+1})
END
